WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.400
How to install 6thSTAR

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Seven steps, right inside your Shopify admin. Each one has a guide.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.500
1. Install. Approve 6thSTAR on Shopify's own screen.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.500
2. Connectors. Connect Shopify: your catalog, orders and returns.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.500
3. Channels. Choose where the line goes.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.500
4. Your creative brief. 6thSTAR writes it for you. You confirm it.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.500
5. What a return costs you. One number.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:38.500
6. Place the line under your review stars. The guide shows each click.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.500
7. Turn on. You sign off before it goes live.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.800
Live. Every product carries 6thSTAR.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
About 20 minutes to install.* *Product upload time varies.
